// =============================================================================================
// Completeness check for engine-log evidence (PLAN §9.5 rule 3)
//
// After an attempt ends (t1), the harness sends `EVALUATE ROW("hb", 1) // eval-hb {attempt_id}`
// as the persona to each workspace the persona can access, then polls this query. Once the
// heartbeat row is visible, earlier rows for the window are assumed ingested (validated by
// spike S2). If it never arrives within settings.evidence.max_wait_s, routing is INCONCLUSIVE,
// never FAIL.
//   {t1}          attempt end in UTC, ISO 8601
//   {upn}         the persona's user principal name
//   {attempt_id}  the attempt's UUID
// =============================================================================================
SemanticModelLogs
| where Timestamp > datetime({t1})
| where ExecutingUser =~ "{upn}" and EventText contains "eval-hb {attempt_id}"
| take 1
